        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-09_46866_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Schedule Page 120 Line:52.1 Column: b</p><p>Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP. </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-94_46867_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: initial; text-align: inherit">Schedule Page: 102 Line No.: 1 Column: a</span><br /></p><p class="_Normal_" style="text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none">The following are the intermediary companies in the chain of ownership between Energy Transfer LP (DE) and Sunoco Pipeline L.P. (TX): </span></p><p class="_Normal_"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit">Energy Transfer LP owns 99.99% LP interests in Sunoco Pipeline L.P. through its 100% ownership of ET CC Holdings LLC (DE).</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-101_46868_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><div><p><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit">Schedule Page: 102 Line No.: 2 Column: a</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><br /></span></p></div><div class="Section0"><p class="_Normal_"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: initial; text-align: inherit">The following are the intermediary companies in the chain of ownership between Energy Transfer LP (DE) and Sunoco Pipeline L.P. (TX):</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; background-color: initial; text-align: inherit"></span><span style="background-color: unset; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; text-align: inherit">Energy Transfer LP owns 100% of Energy Transfer Operations GP LLC (DE) through its 100% ownership of ET CC Holdings LLC (DE).   Energy Transfer Operations GP LLC owns 0.01% GP interests in Sunoco Pipeline, L.P. (TX).</span></p></div></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-403_47258_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $27.9 million are included in Account(s) 600.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-818_47018_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: inherit"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments due to Asset Unitization of ($ 372,855,657) and Capital Interest true up of $299,390,682.</span></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1004_47296_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments reflect $ 565,977 of asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense and $ 6,613,051 of prior year conveyance true up.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1083_46977_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Schedule Page 120 Line:52.1 Column: a</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP. </p></div></link:footnote>
