        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1675_47404_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1676_47405_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 ("Order") issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permited in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $14,483,185 are included in Line 10, Interstate Operating Revenue. These revenues represent a one-time event and are not representative of future revenues.</span></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>